{
    "title": "X-Design-AI Photo Editor",
    "description": "X-Design is an AI photo editor that helps you create images with ease. Enjoy easy-to-use background remover, AI background generator, and AI photo enhancer- right at your fingertips!\r\n\r\nUnlock your creativity with our all-in-one Free AI photo editor, packed with dozens of stylish preset AI backgrounds, filters for photos, templates, stickers, fonts, and more.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s a simple way to create product visuals for e-commerce like Shopify, eBay, Etsy, portrait photography, websites, social media posts, and more. \r\n\r\nX-Design offers everything you want to make your photos stand out, whether you\u2019re a creator, small business, student, or entrepreneur.\r\n\r\nAI-POWERED MAGIC. A COMPLETE SUITE OF AI TOOLS.\r\nComplex photo editing made simple with X-Design AI photo editor.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fAuto Background Remover: Instantly remove background from any photo to get a transparent background, and then change background to an AI background or color. \r\n- Powerful bg remover delivers precise and accurate photo cutting\r\n- Effortlessly erase backgrounds from any type of image\r\n- Precise control to edit backgrounds with Magic Brush, Blur Background and AI Backgrounds\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fAI Background Generator: X-Design's AI-powered background generator helps you change background of any photo to an amazing AI generated background.\r\n- Content Aware algorithm is smart enough to recognize and adapt background to the object\r\n- Offer 500+ stylish preset background scenes freely fit your photos\r\n- Need something specific? Just describe your desired background, and let our AI generates\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fAI Photo Enhancer: Enhance photo quality in one click. Automatically adjust lighting, unblur photos, and enhance details to transform blurry photos into clear.\r\n- Instantly clarify blurry photos. Fix out of focus, pixelated, and low-resolution images\r\n- Increase the number of pixels in low quality photos and retouch them\r\n- Enlarge up to 4x, bring high resolution and smooth image details at the time\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fAI Object Remover: Remove any unwanted objects from your images with AI, automatically remove as if it was never there!\r\n- Fast and easy to remove people, text, watermark, stamps and other distractions\r\n- Recreate the removed area seamlessly using image inpainting techniques\r\n\r\nThe AI photo editor deserves your try right away. Create, edit, and organize perfect photo shots automatically and free. It\u2019s why thousands of online sellers and creators choose X-Design to get their list faster and make more sales.\r\n\r\nDownload X-Design and make your photos shine today!\r\n\r\nSubscribe to have unlimited access to all the premium features as well.\r\nX-Design Pro subscriptions are charged monthly or yearly to your Google Play Account as soon as you confirm your purchase. You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal from your Account Settings after the purchase. Your subscription will renew automatically, unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. When canceling a subscription, your subscription will stay active until the end of the period.\r\n\r\nHave feature requests, questions, or feedback? Do not hesitate to reach us at support@x-design.com.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://x-design.com/terms-of-service\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://x-design.com/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "X-Design is an AI photo editor that helps you create images with ease. Enjoy easy-to-use background remover, AI background generator, and AI photo enhancer- right at your fingertips!<br><br>Unlock your creativity with our all-in-one Free AI photo editor, packed with dozens of stylish preset AI backgrounds, filters for photos, templates, stickers, fonts, and more.<br><br>It\u2019s a simple way to create product visuals for e-commerce like Shopify, eBay, Etsy, portrait photography, websites, social media posts, and more. <br><br>X-Design offers everything you want to make your photos stand out, whether you\u2019re a creator, small business, student, or entrepreneur.<br><br>AI-POWERED MAGIC. A COMPLETE SUITE OF AI TOOLS.<br>Complex photo editing made simple with X-Design AI photo editor.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1fAuto Background Remover: Instantly remove background from any photo to get a transparent background, and then change background to an AI background or color. <br>- Powerful bg remover delivers precise and accurate photo cutting<br>- Effortlessly erase backgrounds from any type of image<br>- Precise control to edit backgrounds with Magic Brush, Blur Background and AI Backgrounds<br><br>\ud83c\udf1fAI Background Generator: X-Design&#39;s AI-powered background generator helps you change background of any photo to an amazing AI generated background.<br>- Content Aware algorithm is smart enough to recognize and adapt background to the object<br>- Offer 500+ stylish preset background scenes freely fit your photos<br>- Need something specific? Just describe your desired background, and let our AI generates<br><br>\ud83c\udf1fAI Photo Enhancer: Enhance photo quality in one click. Automatically adjust lighting, unblur photos, and enhance details to transform blurry photos into clear.<br>- Instantly clarify blurry photos. Fix out of focus, pixelated, and low-resolution images<br>- Increase the number of pixels in low quality photos and retouch them<br>- Enlarge up to 4x, bring high resolution and smooth image details at the time<br><br>\ud83c\udf1fAI Object Remover: Remove any unwanted objects from your images with AI, automatically remove as if it was never there!<br>- Fast and easy to remove people, text, watermark, stamps and other distractions<br>- Recreate the removed area seamlessly using image inpainting techniques<br><br>The AI photo editor deserves your try right away. Create, edit, and organize perfect photo shots automatically and free. It\u2019s why thousands of online sellers and creators choose X-Design to get their list faster and make more sales.<br><br>Download X-Design and make your photos shine today!<br><br>Subscribe to have unlimited access to all the premium features as well.<br>X-Design Pro subscriptions are charged monthly or yearly to your Google Play Account as soon as you confirm your purchase. You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal from your Account Settings after the purchase. Your subscription will renew automatically, unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. When canceling a subscription, your subscription will stay active until the end of the period.<br><br>Have feature requests, questions, or feedback? Do not hesitate to reach us at support@x-design.com.<br><br>Terms of Service: https://x-design.com/terms-of-service<br>Privacy Policy: https://x-design.com/privacy-policy",
